WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.210
The Summer Triangle.

00:01.985 --> 00:08.202
Three bright stars from three different figures: Vega in the Lyre, Deneb in the Swan, Altair in the Eagle.

00:08.700 --> 00:14.210
The pale band running between them is the Milky Way, shown as a long exposure would catch it.

00:14.806 --> 00:20.922
In China it is the Silver River, which parts the Weaver Girl, Vega, from the Cowherd, Altair.
